## Interface: 16001
## Title: Wealth Planner
## Notes: A Wally plugin that treats the auction house like a stock market, keeps a share of your wealth invested, and posts the best-paying jobs (farming, gathering, crafting) on a Jobs Board with map pins (and the Waypoint addon's arrow, if installed). /wp
## Author: Dinoblankie + Claude
## Version: 0.1.2
## Dependencies: Wally
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, Waypoint
## SavedVariables: WealthPlannerDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: WealthPlannerCharDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\WealthPlanner\Media\Icon
## Category: Auction & Economy
## AddonCompartmentFunc: WealthPlanner_OnCompartmentClick
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1759573

